        SDK substantially similar to the Licensed Work; AND
    (b) is provided, licensed, distributed, sold, made available, or otherwise
        offered to any third party as a standalone product/service, or as a
        component whose primary purpose is to enable third parties to run
        mini-games.

  Without limiting the foregoing, a Competitive Offering includes:
    1) Distributing the Licensed Work (or a Derivative Work) as a standalone
       SDK/engine, including as a separately packaged library/framework/toolkit,
       whether in source or binary form.

    2) Offering a hosted, cloud, or managed mini-game runtime/engine service to
       third parties where the Licensed Work (or a Derivative Work) is used to
       provide the core runtime/engine functionality.

    3) Forking, rebranding, repackaging, or otherwise creating a new mini-game
       engine product based on the Licensed Work for provision to third parties.

