  Subject to the terms of this License, and notwithstanding the Use Limitation,
  Licensor grants you a limited right to make production use of the Licensed Work
  only as part of Your App, and only for so long as you are a Small Entity.

  "Your App" means an application that you (or your affiliates) own and control
  and that is distributed to end users primarily to provide your own application
  functionality (not primarily to provide a mini-game runtime/engine SDK).

  "Small Entity" means an entity that, together with its affiliates, satisfies
  both of the following as of its most recently completed fiscal year:
    (a) total annual gross revenue, from all sources and not only from Your App,
        of no more than USD 1,000,000 (or the equivalent in another currency);
        AND
    (b) no more than 3,000,000 monthly active users across all instances of
        Your App in any single month of that year.

  If you cease to be a Small Entity, this Additional Use Grant continues to
  cover your production use for 90 days, so that you have time to obtain a
  commercial license from Licensor without interrupting your service.

  Non-production use is not affected by the Small Entity thresholds. The Terms
  below grant everyone, at any scale, the right to copy, modify, create
  derivative works from, redistribute, and make non-production use of the
  Licensed Work -- including reading, auditing, building, testing, evaluating,
  benchmarking, and porting it.

  Permitted production uses:
    1) Integrate the Licensed Work into Your App to run and deliver mini-games
       within Your App for Your App’s end users.

    2) Internal development, testing, evaluation, learning, and research.

    3) Modify the Licensed Work as necessary solely for your integration into
       Your App and for operating mini-games within Your App.

    4) Develop, publish, and distribute mini-games that run on top of the
       Licensed Work, provided that you do not distribute the Licensed Work
       (or a Derivative Work) as a standalone SDK/engine or as a Competitive
